      "en": "Paul, looking steadfastly at the council, said, “Brothers, I have lived before God in all good conscience until today.”",
      "ko": "바울이 공회를 주목하여 가로되 여러분 형제들아 오늘날까지 내가 범사에 양심을 따라 하나님을 섬겼노라 하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "4afb69b689cecd9386973cf117fc039edb62bb3e924a736c2288f31e1d7434e6",
      "translation_text_hash": "36f9aef9166d37f8c71a447840e03e0d044f72e3510637c4b0b63c51867853bd",
