      "en": "The high priest, Ananias, commanded those who stood by him to strike him on the mouth.",
      "ko": "대제사장 아나니아가 바울 곁에 섰는 사람들에게 그 입을 치라 명하니",
      "source_text_hash": "94396e69288bc2447b6936da163aa59d4918e1a06aedbb94407c48a9b2ad8f5e",
