      "en": "Those who stood by said, “Do you malign God’s high priest?”",
      "ko": "곁에 선 사람들이 말하되 하나님의 대제사장을 네가 욕하느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "bdc276138c15b90ad112888c582bb11868742c4820ce34eac3b8c14b6e78904d",
      "translation_text_hash": "93db01b00357e94a2461253e3309f7a3b61f7917fce2b299a579360d70f01401",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
