          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "They came to the chief priests and the elders, and said, “We have bound ourselves under a great curse to taste nothing until we have killed Paul.",
      "ko": "대제사장들과 장로들에게 가서 말하되 우리가 바울을 죽이기 전에는 아무 것도 먹지 않기로 굳게 맹세하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "d27b9c338aa35e10fd0e450ecce8a7dd1c1bc02eda1c0a7c57aabefdf1a712fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "0233da0b40ec38321103b6e13100d75a478907202ac22638c431b1aa57d6193b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
