      "en": "But Paul’s sister’s son heard they were lying in wait, and he came and entered into the barracks and told Paul.",
      "ko": "바울의 생질이 그들이 매복하여 있다 함을 듣고 와서 영문에 들어가 바울에게 고한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "b55e8bdfa404cc7644fb5ff2c0f673eecbda4459dc746cbf7ffc6befd76795d4",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f701699876bc4d6f39aa6ac832b30beab00ec144c25fb4d8413cf1ade0f4ec8",
