      "en": "So he took him and brought him to the commanding officer and said, “Paul, the prisoner, summoned me and asked me to bring this young man to you. He has something to tell you.”",
      "ko": "천부장에게로 데리고 가서 가로되 죄수 바울이 나를 불러 이 청년이 당신께 할 말이 있다 하여 데리고 가기를 청하더이다 하매",
      "source_text_hash": "3f6c06309fd12d2fdd66b886c25224ad40cbaf2f2c432d0af13da15c90e95a42",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d8c15a0e2341aba00283799ce4adf294b074ac4abf6c8f1ffa33f89103b4d51",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
