      "en": "The commanding officer took him by the hand, and going aside, asked him privately, “What is it that you have to tell me?”",
      "ko": "천부장이 그 손을 잡고 물러가서 종용히 묻되 내게 할 말이 무엇이냐",
      "source_text_hash": "209e4c67e4a48afe68c639bef22eec713e8b6e94eb038d05b2521408583484bf",
      "translation_text_hash": "39855e86558906a18435db80d48814ba6a2e9ab6c40c02b1dd6ea999fb594b02",
