      "en": "He called to himself two of the centurions, and said, “Prepare two hundred soldiers to go as far as Caesarea, with seventy horsemen and two hundred men armed with spears, at the third hour of the night.”",
      "ko": "백부장 둘을 불러 이르되 밤 제삼시에 가이사랴까지 갈 보병 이백 명과 마병 칠십 명과 창군 이백 명을 준비하라 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "2c10e0fa3494e21ba99d1158c49b628ccfa3b977a97ca7724b1a2adca558e09e",
      "translation_text_hash": "4f39fff727c531f24f266cb61e7089bf525f3a7f222a883458798ddcb738b8a5",
