      "en": "I found him to be accused about questions of their law, but not to be charged with anything worthy of death or of imprisonment.",
      "ko": "송사하는 것이 저희 율법 문제에 관한 것뿐이요 한 가지도 죽이거나 결박할 사건이 없음을 발견하였나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "cd21f6da775eb227acd5c69490f975c5c55ae1b9a82429bd0c9ae94a2934022c",
      "translation_text_hash": "22da22d0c69a16613a7cbd4c749159a5e274948c1fa551d7096a569ca1463702",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
