      "en": "When I was told that the Jews lay in wait for the man, I sent him to you immediately, charging his accusers also to bring their accusations against him before you. Farewell.”",
      "ko": "그러나 이 사람을 해하려는 간계가 있다고 누가 내게 알게 하기로 곧 당신께로 보내며 또 송사하는 사람들도 당신 앞에서 그를 대하여 말하라 하였나이다 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "2def40d06ae76a5218b55413e55c6eecc69c26ccaaaf2a6acc32b6a3137d14c5",
      "translation_text_hash": "cd0fbae61770b4e127c7f3d36863c303cb728cb47f05a01cf8126cd0221cf60d",
