      "en": "When the governor had read it, he asked what province he was from. When he understood that he was from Cilicia, he said,",
      "ko": "총독이 읽고 바울더러 어느 영지 사람이냐 물어 길리기아 사람인줄 알고",
      "source_text_hash": "51db249f631296479fabcb303f473ced1c40f71cd7614bd554cc5e6d74ee3c1f",
      "translation_text_hash": "43b4213b5549b3855e65f0809a34976c17e33ae9db0803994cea3349c33b2119",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
